    {
      "file": "pcm-career-options-chain.webp",
      "mobile": "pcm-career-options-chain-mobile.webp",
      "alt": "Planning steps for PCM Career Options.",
      "caption": "Steps in the order they happen.",
      "heading": "Do Not Panic and Overreact in One",
      "content": {
        "kind": "bundle",
        "sourceNeedCount": 5,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "needId": "checklist:1",
            "type": "checklist",
            "heading": "Then See What Happens",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Take PCM, then prepare for engineering, then see what happens."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "If you are good at maths, coding will automatically fit you."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Any engineering branch is fine if the college looks respectable."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Pure science is only for toppers or for students with no other plan."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "why",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 1
          },
          {
            "needId": "checklist:5",
            "type": "checklist",
            "heading": "PCM Still Gives You Strong Options",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "It sounds prestigious from far away."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "You only know the exam, not the work."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "You are copying what everyone else is doing."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "not-engineering",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 5
          },
          {
            "needId": "chain:10",
            "type": "chain",
            "heading": "Overreact in One Bad",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Map what still transfers."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Use a side project, short tool-based output, or deeper exposure to test the alternate direction before making a dramatic jump."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Review the move with cost and timing in mind."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "already-joined",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 10
          },
          {
            "needId": "chain:11",
            "type": "chain",
            "heading": "Spending Heavily on a PCM Path",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "If nobody in the discussion can describe the real daily work, the family is probably choosing a label, not a career."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Coaching, college fees, hostel costs, and lost time all matter."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Ask how the student will build proof."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Strong planning does not mean weak commitment."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "parents",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 11
          },
          {
            "needId": "checklist:12",
            "type": "checklist",
            "heading": "Next If You Are Serious About Choosing",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "If you want the broader science map, read career options after 12th science next."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "If you are comparing streams and suspect the fit might actually lean away from science, compare it with career options after 12th commerce."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "If the quantitative business-tech side stood out to you, also read career options in commerce and compare the actual work, not just the stream label."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "If you took PCB instead but also studied Computer Science, read career options in PCB with Computer Science for the honest map of what that combination unlocks and what it does not."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "To see what these paths pay at each stage, read PCM career options with salary."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "For seats, ranks and fees behind these paths, read the career options after JEE."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "next-step",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 12
          }
        ]
      },
      "type": "chain",
      "title": "Do Not Panic and Overreact in One"
